---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Panduan MPASI', url: '/panduan' }];
---

<Layout
  title="Panduan Lengkap MPASI Bayi 6-24 Bulan (Sesuai IDAI & WHO)"
  description="Panduan tahap demi tahap pemberian MPASI bayi usia 6-24 bulan: tekstur makanan, jadwal makan, aturan feeding rules IDAI, pencegahan anemia dan alergi."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  type="website"
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-6 mb-16 space-y-4">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-orange-soft dark:bg-brand-orange/20 text-brand-orange-hover dark:text-brand-orange text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        Pedoman Resmi & Teruji
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-brand-charcoal dark:text-gray-100">
        Panduan Tekstur, Porsi, & Jadwal MPASI
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-brand-charcoal/80 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        Ikuti panduan tahapan tekstur sesuai usia si Kecil agar melatih motorik mulut dengan tepat tanpa resiko tersedak atau trauma makan.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Tahapan Usia MPASI -->
    <div class="space-y-8 mb-20">
      
      <!-- Usia 6-8 Bulan -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#252A26] border border-brand-sage/20 shadow-organic relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-sage-soft/60 dark:bg-brand-sage/10 rounded-bl-full -z-0 pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-sage text-white font-bold text-sm">Usia 6 - 8 Bulan</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-charcoal-muted">Tekstur: Lumat (Puree & Mashed Halus)</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal dark:text-gray-100">Fase Pengenalan & Pemenuhan Zat Besi</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm text-brand-charcoal/80 dark:text-gray-300">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-cream/60 dark:bg-zinc-800">
              <strong class="block text-brand-sage-dark dark:text-brand-sage-light mb-1">Porsi & Frekuensi</strong>
              2-3 kali makan utama, 1-2 kali snack. Porsi: 2-3 sendok makan dewasa secara bertahap hingga 1/2 mangkok (125ml).
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-cream/60 dark:bg-zinc-800">
              <strong class="block text-brand-sage-dark dark:text-brand-sage-light mb-1">Ciri Tekstur Pas</strong>
              Semi-kental, tidak cair seperti sup. Saat sendok dimiringkan perlahan, makanan tidak langsung meluncur tumpah.
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-cream/60 dark:bg-zinc-800">
              <strong class="block text-brand-sage-dark dark:text-brand-sage-light mb-1">Bahan Utama</strong>
              Hati ayam, daging sapi, ikan kembung, telur matang sempurna, minyak kelapa/butter, dan sedikit sayur labu/wortel.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Usia 9-11 Bulan -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#252A26] border border-brand-sage/20 shadow-organic relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-orange-soft/40 dark:bg-brand-orange/10 rounded-bl-full -z-0 pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-orange text-white font-bold text-sm">Usia 9 - 11 Bulan</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-charcoal-muted">Tekstur: Cincang Halus & Kasar (Minced / Chopped)</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal dark:text-gray-100">Fase Mengunyah & Motorik Halus (Finger Food)</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm text-brand-charcoal/80 dark:text-gray-300">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-cream/60 dark:bg-zinc-800">
              <strong class="block text-brand-orange mb-1">Porsi & Frekuensi</strong>
              3-4 kali makan utama, 1-2 kali selingan. Porsi: 1/2 mangkok 250ml per sesi makan.
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-cream/60 dark:bg-zinc-800">
              <strong class="block text-brand-orange mb-1">Ciri Tekstur Pas</strong>
              Makanan dicincang tanpa disaring halus. Anak mulai mampu mengambil potongan finger food lunak dengan jari jempol dan telunjuk.
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-cream/60 dark:bg-zinc-800">
              <strong class="block text-brand-orange mb-1">Menu Andalan</strong>
              Bubur kasar tim, perkedel kentang daging, nugget tahu ayam kukus homemade, dan brokoli kukus lunak.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Usia 12-24 Bulan -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#252A26] border border-brand-sage/20 shadow-organic relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-charcoal dark:bg-zinc-700 text-white font-bold text-sm">Usia 12 - 24 Bulan</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-charcoal-muted">Tekstur: Makanan Keluarga (Family Food)</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-brand-charcoal dark:text-gray-100">Fase Kemandirian Meja Makan</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm text-brand-charcoal/80 dark:text-gray-300">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-cream/60 dark:bg-zinc-800">
              <strong class="block text-brand-charcoal dark:text-gray-100 mb-1">Porsi & Frekuensi</strong>
              3 kali makan besar bersama keluarga, 2 kali camilan sehat. Porsi: 3/4 hingga 1 mangkok penuh (250ml).
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-cream/60 dark:bg-zinc-800">
              <strong class="block text-brand-charcoal dark:text-gray-100 mb-1">Ciri Tekstur Pas</strong>
              Nasi lembek atau nasi biasa, lauk yang dipotong kecil sesuai gigitan anak. Hindari rasa terlalu pedas atau asin berlebih.
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-brand-cream/60 dark:bg-zinc-800">
              <strong class="block text-brand-charcoal dark:text-gray-100 mb-1">Kebiasaan Sehat</strong>
              Makan bersama di meja makan menggunakan kursi bayi (high chair) untuk membangun kebiasaan makan positif seumur hidup.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Feeding Rules Section IDAI -->
    <div id="feeding-rules" class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-brand-sage-soft dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-brand-sage/30 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-charcoal dark:text-gray-100">
        3 Aturan Makan Emas (Feeding Rules IDAI)
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-brand-charcoal/80 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        Jika si Kecil mulai menunjukkan gelagat GTM, cek kembali 3 pilar feeding rules berikut:
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-2">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-zinc-800 p-6 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
          <span class="font-display font-bold text-brand-orange text-lg">1. Jadwal (Schedule)</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-charcoal/80 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            Makan tidak boleh lebih dari 30 menit. Jangan beri camilan atau susu formula 2 jam sebelum jam makan agar anak merasa lapar alami.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-zinc-800 p-6 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
          <span class="font-display font-bold text-brand-sage-dark dark:text-brand-sage-light text-lg">2. Lingkungan</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-charcoal/80 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            Bebas distraksi layar HP, televisi, atau mainan keliling kompleks. Ciptakan suasana makan yang menyenangkan tanpa paksaan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-zinc-800 p-6 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
          <span class="font-display font-bold text-brand-orange text-lg">3. Prosedur</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-charcoal/80 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            Berikan porsi kecil terlebih dahulu. Tawarkan air putih di sela makanan. Hentikan proses makan dengan tenang jika anak marah atau menangis.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
